This service is for you if:  
- your family lives in, or have a connection to, Islington with children under 18; 
- you're a parent, a child or a young person who is concerned about someone else's drug or alcohol use and would like to talk to someone; 
- you're an adult affected by someone else’s drug or alcohol use.  
Please note that it is not a requirement to have children in order to access the service. Children and adults can access the service with no age restrictions.

Monday 9am - 8pm ; 
Tuesday 9am - 5pm ; 
Wednesday 9am - 5pm ; 
Thursday 10am - 5pm ; 
Friday 9am - 4pm

